>>
Rule 11 (values list should have at least one tensor)
{v_1 : list(tensor)} |= v_1.len > 0
>>
Rule 12 (message_type should be a non-empty string)
{v_1 : str} |= v_1.len > 0
>>
Rule 13 (field_names should be a non-empty list)
{v_1 : list(str)} |= v_1.len > 0
>>
Rule 21 (sizes tensor should have at least one dimension)
{v_1 : tensor} |= ndim(v_1) > 0
>>
